Description: OneDrive synchronization client with terminal and optional desktop interfaces
 Synchronize files with Microsoft OneDrive using Microsoft Graph.
 Provides command-line and terminal interfaces, selective synchronization,
 filesystem monitoring, persistent local state, and a systemd user service.
 An optional Qt desktop interface can be included at build time.
